      "message": "+1 to svv@\u0027s perspective.\n\nI would add that \"CursorController\" can also be ambiguous. I would take another step and suggest \"MouseCursorController\" and \"TouchSpotController\" for taking away more ambiguity. \n\nThis also makes it clear that Spots are tied to Touch devices like Touch{pad,screen}.",
